{"seq":2,"slug":"gan-variants","title":"GAN 变体与演进","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/gan-and-vae/gan-variants","wordCount":1400,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"gan-变体与演进\">GAN 变体与演进</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>从 2014 年原始 GAN 到 2024 年的 GigaGAN，GAN 架构经历了十年的快速演进。这条技术路线围绕两个核心挑战展开：提升生成图像的分辨率和真实感，以及增强对生成过程的精确控制。DCGAN 奠定了卷积 GAN 的基础架构，ProGAN 引入渐进式训练突破了高分辨率生成的瓶颈，StyleGAN 系列通过风格注入机制实现了对生成图像各个层面的精细控制。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[GAN 2014] --&gt; B[DCGAN 2015]&#10;    B --&gt; C[WGAN 2017]&#10;    C --&gt; D[ProGAN 2017]&#10;    D --&gt; E[StyleGAN 2018]&#10;    E --&gt; F[StyleGAN2 2020]&#10;    F --&gt; G[StyleGAN3 2021]&#10;    B --&gt; H[Pix2Pix 2016]&#10;    H --&gt; I[CycleGAN 2017]&#10;    I --&gt; J[SPADE 2019]&#10;    G --&gt; K[GigaGAN 2023]\">graph LR\n    A[GAN 2014] --&gt; B[DCGAN 2015]\n    B --&gt; C[WGAN 2017]\n    C --&gt; D[ProGAN 2017]\n    D --&gt; E[StyleGAN 2018]\n    E --&gt; F[StyleGAN2 2020]\n    F --&gt; G[StyleGAN3 2021]\n    B --&gt; H[Pix2Pix 2016]\n    H --&gt; I[CycleGAN 2017]\n    I --&gt; J[SPADE 2019]\n    G --&gt; K[GigaGAN 2023]</pre><p>每一代 GAN 的改进都有明确的技术焦点，从网络结构设计到训练策略优化，从无条件生成到条件可控生成。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>年份</th>\n<th>核心创新</th>\n<th>最大分辨率</th>\n<th>FID (最佳)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DCGAN</td>\n<td>2015</td>\n<td>卷积架构规范</td>\n<td>64×64</td>\n<td>~30</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ProGAN</td>\n<td>2017</td>\n<td>渐进式生长训练</td>\n<td>1024×1024</td>\n<td>8.04</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>StyleGAN</td>\n<td>2018</td>\n<td>风格注入 + AdaIN</td>\n<td>1024×1024</td>\n<td>4.40</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>StyleGAN2</td>\n<td>2020</td>\n<td>权重调制 + 路径正则</td>\n<td>1024×1024</td>\n<td>2.84</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>StyleGAN3</td>\n<td>2021</td>\n<td>等变设计消除伪影</td>\n<td>1024×1024</td>\n<td>3.07</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GigaGAN</td>\n<td>2023</td>\n<td>大规模条件 GAN</td>\n<td>4096×4096</td>\n<td>9.09</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"stylegan-架构体系\">StyleGAN 架构体系</h2><p>StyleGAN 是 GAN 发展史上最具影响力的架构创新。它引入映射网络和风格注入机制，将生成过程分解为&quot;内容&quot;和&quot;风格&quot;两个层面。输入噪声 z 首先通过 8 层 MLP 映射网络转化为中间隐空间 W 中的向量 w，然后 w 通过仿射变换生成缩放和偏移参数（风格向量），注入到合成网络每一层的 AdaIN（自适应实例归一化）中。</p>\n<p>W 空间相比 Z 空间具有更好的解耦特性。由于映射网络可以学习非线性变换来&quot;展开&quot;隐空间中的纠缠结构，W 空间中的线性操作（如插值和方向编辑）对应更自然的语义变化。不同层的风格向量控制不同粒度的属性——浅层控制姿态和形状，中间层控制面部特征，深层控制颜色和微细节。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class MappingNetwork(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, z_dim=512, w_dim=512, n_layers=8):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        layers = []&#10;        for i in range(n_layers):&#10;            in_dim = z_dim if i == 0 else w_dim&#10;            layers.extend([nn.Linear(in_dim, w_dim), nn.LeakyReLU(0.2)])&#10;        self.net = nn.Sequential(*layers)&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, z):&#10;        return self.net(z)&#10;&#10;class AdaIN(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, channels, w_dim=512):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.norm = nn.InstanceNorm2d(channels)&#10;        self.style = nn.Linear(w_dim, channels * 2)&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x, w):&#10;        style = self.style(w).unsqueeze(-1).unsqueeze(-1)&#10;        gamma, beta = style.chunk(2, dim=1)&#10;        return gamma * self.norm(x) + beta&#10;&#10;class SynthesisBlock(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, in_channels, out_channels, w_dim=512):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.conv = nn.Conv2d(in_channels, out_channels, 3, padding=1)&#10;        self.adain = AdaIN(out_channels, w_dim)&#10;        self.noise_scale = nn.Parameter(torch.zeros(1))&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x, w):&#10;        x = self.conv(x)&#10;        noise = torch.randn(x.shape[0], 1, x.shape[2], x.shape[3], device=x.device)&#10;        x = x + self.noise_scale * noise&#10;        return self.adain(x, w)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MappingNetwork</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, z_dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, w_dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, n_layers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        layers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n_layers):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            in_dim </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z_dim </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w_dim</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            layers.extend([nn.Linear(in_dim, w_dim), nn.LeakyReLU(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.net </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">layers)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, z):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.net(z)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AdaIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, channels, w_dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.norm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.InstanceNorm2d(channels)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.style </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Linear(w_dim, channels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x, w):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        style </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.style(w).unsqueeze(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).unsqueeze(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        gamma, beta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> style.chunk(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gamma </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.norm(x) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> beta</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SynthesisBlock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, in_channels, out_channels, w_dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.conv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Conv2d(in_channels, out_channels, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.adain </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AdaIN(out_channels, w_dim)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.noise_scale </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Parameter(torch.zeros(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x, w):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.conv(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        noise </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.randn(x.shape[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, x.shape[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], x.shape[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">device</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">x.device)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.noise_scale </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> noise</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.adain(x, w)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>StyleGAN2 改进了三个关键方面：一是用权重调制（Weight Modulation/Demodulation）替代 AdaIN，消除了 AdaIN 引入的水滴伪影；二是引入路径长度正则化，鼓励 W 空间中的等距变化产生等比例的图像变化；三是改进了渐进式增长策略，采用跳跃连接和残差结构。StyleGAN3 进一步通过等变卷积设计消除了纹理粘连（texture sticking）伪影。</p>\n<h2 id=\"图像翻译与-cyclegan\">图像翻译与 CycleGAN</h2><p>图像翻译任务的目标是学习从一个视觉域到另一个视觉域的映射。Pix2Pix 使用成对训练数据，通过条件 GAN 加 L1 重构损失实现精确的图像翻译。其 PatchGAN 判别器只在局部 patch 级别判断真假，而非整张图像，这一设计使判别器更高效且对图像尺寸不敏感。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph CycleGAN&#10;        A[域 A 图像] --&gt; GAB[G: A→B]&#10;        GAB --&gt; B1[生成域 B]&#10;        B1 --&gt; GBA[G: B→A]&#10;        GBA --&gt; A1[重构域 A]&#10;        B[域 B 图像] --&gt; GBA2[G: B→A]&#10;        GBA2 --&gt; A2[生成域 A]&#10;        A2 --&gt; GAB2[G: A→B]&#10;        GAB2 --&gt; B2[重构域 B]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph CycleGAN\n        A[域 A 图像] --&gt; GAB[G: A→B]\n        GAB --&gt; B1[生成域 B]\n        B1 --&gt; GBA[G: B→A]\n        GBA --&gt; A1[重构域 A]\n        B[域 B 图像] --&gt; GBA2[G: B→A]\n        GBA2 --&gt; A2[生成域 A]\n        A2 --&gt; GAB2[G: A→B]\n        GAB2 --&gt; B2[重构域 B]\n    end</pre><p>CycleGAN 的突破在于无需成对训练数据即可实现域间翻译。它通过两个生成器 G: A→B 和 F: B→A 加循环一致性损失 ||F(G(x)) - x||₁ + ||G(F(y)) - y||₁ 来约束映射关系。循环一致性确保翻译是可逆的，避免了模式崩塌到无关图像的问题。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class ResnetGenerator(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, input_nc=3, output_nc=3, ngf=64, n_blocks=9):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        model = [nn.ReflectionPad2d(3), nn.Conv2d(input_nc, ngf, 7), nn.InstanceNorm2d(ngf), nn.ReLU()]&#10;        for i in range(2):&#10;            mult = 2 ** i&#10;            model += [nn.Conv2d(ngf * mult, ngf * mult * 2, 3, 2, 1),&#10;                      nn.InstanceNorm2d(ngf * mult * 2), nn.ReLU()]&#10;        mult = 4&#10;        for _ in range(n_blocks):&#10;            model += [ResnetBlock(ngf * mult)]&#10;        for i in range(2):&#10;            mult = 2 ** (2 - i)&#10;            model += [nn.ConvTranspose2d(ngf * mult, ngf * mult // 2, 3, 2, 1, output_padding=1),&#10;                      nn.InstanceNorm2d(ngf * mult // 2), nn.ReLU()]&#10;        model += [nn.ReflectionPad2d(3), nn.Conv2d(ngf, output_nc, 7), nn.Tanh()]&#10;        self.model = nn.Sequential(*model)&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x):&#10;        return self.model(x)&#10;&#10;class ResnetBlock(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, dim):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.block = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.ReflectionPad2d(1), nn.Conv2d(dim, dim, 3), nn.InstanceNorm2d(dim), nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.ReflectionPad2d(1), nn.Conv2d(dim, dim, 3), nn.InstanceNorm2d(dim),&#10;        )&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x):&#10;        return x + self.block(x)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ResnetGenerator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, input_nc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, output_nc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ngf</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, n_blocks</span><span style=\"c